 "Swiping through the library in a panic usually deletes the wrong things: one favorite photo instead of the twenty near-identical burst shots beside it. Sorting by type works better. Duplicates take double the space, bursts are many near-identical frames, screenshots pile up for years, and a few long videos often outweigh a thousand photos.": 1,
